  "description": "Client-side inventory mirror for the Altruist wire protocol. Receives ItemSnapshotPacket frames, maintains per-container state with multi-cell coverage tracking, and surfaces SlotChanged / SlotCleared events for UI consumers. Game-specific item fields ride in an opaque payload; the framework never inspects them. Drop-in for Unity, Godot, or any .NET client that already speaks Altruist.",
